msgid ""
"Ранее существовал компонент с ключом **ecos-records-sync**, совмещавший "
"потребителя и производителя. Он удален. Для чтения записей "
"используйте :ref:`ecos-records-sync-consumer "
"<camel_ecos_records_sync_consumer>`, для записи — :ref:`ecos-records-mutate "
"<EcosRecordsMutateEndpoint>` и :ref:`ecos-records-delete "
"<EcosRecordsDeleteEndpoint>`."
msgstr ""
"There used to be a component with the key **ecos-records-sync** that "
"combined a consumer and a producer. It has been removed. Use :ref:`ecos-"
"records-sync-consumer <camel_ecos_records_sync_consumer>` for reading "
"records, and :ref:`ecos-records-mutate <EcosRecordsMutateEndpoint>` and "
":ref:`ecos-records-delete <EcosRecordsDeleteEndpoint>` for writing."

